/F2 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0.31 0.275 0.898 rg
56.6929133858267775 745.5120472440944468 Td
(1.1 Background & Context) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.122 0.161 0.216 rg
56.6929133858267775 728.5041732283464171 Td
(In contemporary personal finance management, maintaining accurate records of daily expenditures is) Tj
T* (essential for budgeting, savings goals, and financial well-being. However, empirical studies in) Tj
T* (human-computer interaction reveal that up to 70% of individuals abandon expense management applications) Tj
T* (within the first four weeks. The primary driver of abandonment is the manual data-entry burden: for every) Tj
T* (coffee, metro ride, or utility invoice, the user must input the date, amount, description, and manually select) Tj
T* (from a taxonomy of spending categories.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (The emergence of applied Natural Language Processing \(NLP\) and supervised Machine Learning \(ML\)) Tj
T* (presents an elegant solution: by learning from historical patterns in short text descriptions, an intelligent agent) Tj
T* (can automatically infer the appropriate semantic category with high statistical confidence.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0.31 0.275 0.898 rg
56.6929133858267775 569.7640157480313974 Td
(1.2 Role of Machine Learning in Text Categorization) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.122 0.161 0.216 rg
56.6929133858267775 552.7561417322833677 Td
(Expense descriptions are inherently brief, colloquial, and diverse—varying from brand names \("Target",) Tj
T* ("Costco", "Starbucks"\) to functional transactions \("electricity payment", "doctor consultation fee", "semester) Tj
T* (book purchase"\). Traditional software implementations rely on brittle regex matching or hardcoded keyword) Tj
T* (dictionaries. These rule-based systems fail when confronted with typos, novel merchants, multilingual tokens,) Tj
T* (or ambiguous vocabulary.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Machine learning transforms this challenge by treating category assignment as a multiclass text classification) Tj
T* (task. By converting textual strings into normalized vector spaces via Term Frequency-Inverse Document) Tj
T* (Frequency \(TF-IDF\), mathematical classifiers can learn probabilistic boundaries across multidimensional) Tj
T* (feature spaces. Furthermore, training both linear and deep neural architectures provides valuable technical) Tj
T* (contrast between linear separability and hierarchical non-linear representations.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0.31 0.275 0.898 rg
56.6929133858267775 379.2758267716534988 Td
(1.3 Academic & Industrial Relevance of the Project) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.122 0.161 0.216 rg
56.6929133858267775 362.2679527559054691 Td
(This project bridges the gap between academic machine learning theory and production software) Tj
T* (engineering. Rather than treating ML as an isolated offline Jupyter notebook or delegating inference to costly) Tj
T* (cloud APIs, this project implements the complete ML inference, vectorization, and training pipeline directly in) Tj
T* (browser client-side TypeScript. This architecture ensures zero server latency, complete user data privacy,) Tj
T* (offline resilience, and transparent model explainability.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 8 Tf
9.1999999999999993 TL
0.392 0.455 0.545 rg
56.6929133858267775 807.8742519685039269 Td
