0.122 0.161 0.216 rg
56.6929133858267775 745.5120472440944468 Td
(Users frequently record personal expenses through disparate mediums, but manually categorizing and) Tj
T* (analyzing those transactions is laborious, repetitive, and error-prone. Existing commercial applications often) Tj
T* (suffer from aggressive telemetry, cloud subscription paywalls, and privacy intrusions. Therefore, the problem) Tj
T* (addressed in this project is:) Tj
T* () Tj
T* ("To architect and engineer a responsive, privacy-first personal expense management system that provides) Tj
T* (seamless transaction recording, dynamic statistical analytics, and automated category classification using an) Tj
T* (explainable, in-browser machine learning pipeline evaluated against empirical performance benchmarks.") Tj
ET
BT
/F2 15 Tf
17.25 TL
0.118 0.227 0.541 rg
56.6929133858267775 616.2522047244094665 Td
(2. PROJECT OBJECTIVES) Tj
ET
0.31 0.27 0.9 RG
2.2677165354330713 w
56.6929133858267775 609.1655905511810261 m
538.5870866141731312 609.1655905511810261 l
S
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.122 0.161 0.216 rg
56.6929133858267775 590.7403937007873083 Td
(1. Web Application Engineering: Construct a modular, responsive single-page application \(SPA\) using React,) Tj
T* (TypeScript, and modern component design principles.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (2. Comprehensive Expense Lifecycle Management: Support adding, viewing, editing, deleting, multi-criteria) Tj
T* (filtering, and searching of expense records.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (3. Automated ML Categorization: Implement client-side text preprocessing, n-gram sublinear TF-IDF) Tj
T* (vectorization, and automated category prediction with confidence scoring.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (4. Dual-Model Comparative Evaluation: Develop and train both a Baseline Multiclass Logistic Regression) Tj
T* (model and an Advanced Wide & Deep Residual Neural Network on identical stratified data.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (5. Empirical Metric Computation: Calculate exact confusion matrices, per-class Precision, Recall, F1-Score,) Tj
T* (and Support on an unseen 20% holdout test set without fabrication.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (6. Explainability & Human Override: Allow users to review top contributing TF-IDF tokens for every prediction) Tj
T* (and manually override suggested categories.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (7. Dynamic Model Retraining: Enable users to teach the model new custom labeled examples with instant) Tj
T* (retraining and dynamic metrics recalculation.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (8. Data Persistence & Interoperability: Provide persistent offline client storage using localStorage and full) Tj
T* (CSV import/export capabilities.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (9. Visual Financial Intelligence: Deliver interactive graphical reports \(category breakdowns, daily trends,) Tj
T* (spending ratios\) utilizing Recharts.) Tj
ET
