(The project scope encompasses single-user personal expense tracking, automated category classification) Tj
T* (across eight standard classes, financial dashboard analytics, and CSV data migration. Realistic boundary) Tj
T* (conditions include operating within browser memory limits, restricting classification to single-sentence) Tj
T* (expense strings, and relying on in-browser training rather than multi-gigabyte cloud foundation models.) Tj
