(1. User Enters Expense Description: As the user enters text \(e.g., "Monthly broadband fiber bill"\), an input) Tj
T* (listener triggers the NLP pipeline.) Tj
T* (2. Text Preprocessing & Cleaning: Text is converted to lowercase, symbols and punctuation are stripped, and) Tj
T* (grammatical stopwords are pruned.) Tj
T* (3. TF-IDF Transformation: Cleaned tokens are mapped into a 580-dimensional sparse feature vector using) Tj
T* (precomputed vocabulary indices and inverse document frequencies.) Tj
T* (4. Active Model Inference: The vector is evaluated by the selected algorithm \(Logistic Regression or Wide &) Tj
T* (Deep ResNet\), generating an 8-class softmax probability distribution.) Tj
T* (5. Explainability & Human Verification: The highest probability category is selected, confidence score is) Tj
T* (displayed, and top contributing TF-IDF tokens are highlighted for user validation.) Tj
T* (6. Transaction Commit: The user verifies or edits the category and saves the record, writing instantly to) Tj
T* (structured localStorage with reactive dashboard recalculation.) Tj
