(6.7 Architectural Design: Wide Linear + Deep Non-Linear Residual) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.122 0.161 0.216 rg
56.6929133858267775 728.5041732283464171 Td
(To evaluate whether deep hierarchical feature combinations could outperform linear boundaries, an advanced) Tj
T* (Wide & Deep Residual Neural Network \(Wide & Deep ResNet\) was implemented:) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (1. Wide Linear Path: A direct sparse linear projection from the 580-dimensional input vector to the 8 output) Tj
T* (classes \(z_wide = W_wide · x + b_wide\). This path specializes in memorizing specific high-confidence) Tj
T* (merchant tokens \(e.g., "netflix", "walmart", "pharmacy"\).) Tj
T* (2. Deep Non-Linear Path: A two-layer dense multilayer perceptron with residual skip connection:) Tj
T* (   • Hidden Layer 1: 580 inputs -> 96 hidden units with LeakyReLU activation \(alpha = 0.01\).) Tj
T* (   • Hidden Layer 2: 96 units -> 48 hidden units with LeakyReLU activation.) Tj
T* (   • Residual Skip Connection: A linear projection adding Hidden Layer 1 outputs directly to Hidden Layer 2) Tj
T* (outputs, preserving gradient flow during backpropagation.) Tj
T* (3. Fusion Output Layer: Combines the wide memorization path with the deep generalization path:) Tj
T* (   • z_combined = 0.9 * z_wide + 0.9 * \(W_out · h2 + b_out\)) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0.31 0.275 0.898 rg
56.6929133858267775 540.2837007874015853 Td
(6.8 Modern Regularization & Optimization Techniques) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.122 0.161 0.216 rg
56.6929133858267775 523.2758267716535556 Td
(• AdamW Optimizer: Decoupled weight decay \(eta = 0.02, beta1 = 0.9, beta2 = 0.999, eps = 1e-8,) Tj
T* (weight_decay = 0.0001\) ensuring parameter shrinkage is independent of gradient scaling.) Tj
T* (• Cosine Annealing Learning Rate Schedule: Gradually lowers the learning rate following a cosine curve) Tj
T* (across 24 training epochs, promoting smooth convergence into flat minima.) Tj
T* (• Label Smoothing \(alpha = 0.1\): Replaces rigid one-hot target vectors with softened distributions \(0.90 for) Tj
T* (ground truth, 0.0125 for alternate classes\). This prevents the softmax layer from becoming overconfident and) Tj
T* (reduces gradient saturation on ambiguous merchant descriptions.) Tj
