(To maintain complete technical credibility, standard evaluation metrics were computed strictly from the true) Tj
T* (positives \(TP\), false positives \(FP\), true negatives \(TN\), and false negatives \(FN\) on the 120-sample holdout) Tj
T* (test partition:) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (• Overall Classification Accuracy:) Tj
T* (    Accuracy = sum\(TP_k\) / Total_Test_Samples) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (• Per-Class Precision: The proportion of positive category predictions that were correct:) Tj
T* (    Precision_k = TP_k / \(TP_k + FP_k\)) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (• Per-Class Recall \(Sensitivity\): The proportion of actual category instances correctly identified:) Tj
T* (    Recall_k = TP_k / \(TP_k + FN_k\)) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (• Per-Class F1-Score: The harmonic mean of precision and recall:) Tj
T* (    F1_k = 2 * \(Precision_k * Recall_k\) / \(Precision_k + Recall_k\)) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (• Macro-Averaged Metrics: Unweighted arithmetic mean across all K = 8 categories, treating every spending) Tj
T* (category with equal importance regardless of frequency:) Tj
T* (    Macro_Metric = \(1 / K\) * sum_{k=1}^K Metric_k) Tj
