56.6929133858267775 478.5911811023621567 Td
(7.3 Technical Analysis: Why Logistic Regression Outperformed the Neural Network) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.122 0.161 0.216 rg
56.6929133858267775 461.583307086614127 Td
(The empirical benchmarks reveal that Multiclass Logistic Regression achieved 75.83% accuracy,) Tj
T* (outperforming the Wide & Deep Residual Neural Network \(70.00% accuracy\) by 5.83 percentage points.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Rather than masking this result, it presents an exemplary engineering finding grounded in fundamental) Tj
T* (machine learning principles:) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (1. High-Dimensional Sparse Feature Space: In text categorization with TF-IDF, individual expense) Tj
T* (descriptions are represented by 580 orthogonal features where only 2 to 5 features are non-zero per) Tj
T* (document. In such sparse, high-dimensional spaces, classes are predominantly linearly separable. A linear) Tj
T* (hyperplane \(Logistic Regression\) naturally defines optimal decision boundaries without warping the space.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (2. The Principle of Parsimony \(Occam's Razor\): The Wide & Deep Neural Network introduces hundreds of) Tj
T* (non-linear parameters across its 96-neuron and 48-neuron dense layers. Given a training corpus of 480) Tj
T* (samples, the ratio of training instances to parameters is relatively low. As a result, the neural network exhibits) Tj
T* (slight variance on ambiguous tokens, whereas the L2-regularized logistic regression converges to a globally) Tj
T* (convex minimum with superior sample efficiency.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (3. Brevity of Expense Descriptions: Unlike long sentiment reviews or scientific articles where multi-hop) Tj
T* (semantic composition is critical, expense descriptions are concise entity names \(e.g., "shell oil gas station"\).) Tj
T* (Linear token-to-class associations provide more direct, robust discriminative signals than deep compositional) Tj
T* (hierarchies.) Tj
