(A transparent engineering evaluation requires identifying categories where models experienced difficulty:) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (1. High-Performing Categories \(Food, Entertainment, Transport\):) Tj
T* (   • Food achieved 82.3% precision and 93.3% recall under Logistic Regression. Strong vocabulary anchors) Tj
T* (like "restaurant", "burger", "coffee", and "bakery" provided unambiguous classification signals.) Tj
T* (   • Entertainment achieved 91.7% precision under Logistic Regression due to unique terms like "cinema",) Tj
T* ("concert", "steam", and "spotify".) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (2. Moderate & Challenging Categories \(Healthcare, Shopping, Other\):) Tj
T* (   • Healthcare registered 60.0% recall. Descriptions such as "cvs prescription pick up" or "target pharmacy) Tj
T* (vitamins" introduce vocabulary overlap with general retail and Shopping, leading the model to misclassify) Tj
T* (healthcare expenses as Shopping.) Tj
T* (   • The "Other" category achieved 69.0% F1 in LR and 57.1% F1 in NN. Because "Other" acts as a residual) Tj
T* (class with heterogeneous descriptions \("courier shipping fee", "atm withdrawal", "passport renewal"\), it lacks) Tj
T* (a cohesive semantic centroid, illustrating a universal challenge in multiclass taxonomy engineering.) Tj
