(10.1 Technical Limitations) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.122 0.161 0.216 rg
56.6929133858267775 728.5041732283464171 Td
(1. Cold-Start Vocabulary Constraints: Out-of-vocabulary \(OOV\) tokens unseen in the 580-term TF-IDF) Tj
T* (dictionary do not generate active feature dimensions, reducing confidence on unfamiliar international) Tj
T* (merchants.) Tj
T* (2. Short-Text Ambiguity: Descriptions containing only generic abbreviations \(e.g., "misc payment", "transfer) Tj
T* (#8492"\) lack sufficient semantic tokens for accurate statistical categorization.) Tj
T* (3. Client Hardware Variability: In-browser deep neural network training latency depends on the client) Tj
T* (machine's JavaScript V8 engine throughput and available CPU cores.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 11.5 Tf
13.2249999999999996 TL
0.31 0.275 0.898 rg
56.6929133858267775 621.9214960629921052 Td
(10.2 Future Scope & Research Directions) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
11.5 TL
0.122 0.161 0.216 rg
56.6929133858267775 604.9136220472440755 Td
(1. WebGPU / ONNX Runtime Transformer Embeddings: Integrating quantized MiniLM or MobileBERT models) Tj
T* (running locally via WebGPU to capture deep contextual semantics without server reliance.) Tj
T* (2. Client-Side Receipt OCR: Leveraging Tesseract.js to automatically parse and extract merchant name,) Tj
T* (transaction date, and total line items from photographed receipts.) Tj
T* (3. Multi-Currency & Automated Bank Sync: Implementing Open Banking API endpoints with real-time) Tj
T* (currency conversion rates.) Tj
T* (4. Hierarchical Sub-Categories: Expanding the 8-class taxonomy to multi-level hierarchical trees \(e.g., Food) Tj
T* (-> Groceries vs. Dining Out\).) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 15 Tf
17.25 TL
0.118 0.227 0.541 rg
56.6929133858267775 479.0553543307086102 Td
(10. CONCLUSION & ACADEMIC LEARNINGS) Tj
