(The "Personal Expense Tracker – ML Enhanced" successfully demonstrates the design, engineering, and) Tj
T* (empirical benchmarking of a complete machine learning system embedded within a modern web application.) Tj
T* (Key project takeaways include:) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (1. Practical Superiority of Occam's Razor: On short, sparse text categorizations, simpler regularized linear) Tj
T* (models \(Multiclass Logistic Regression\) can outperform deeper architectures both in holdout accuracy) Tj
T* (\(76.67% vs 72.50%\) and computational efficiency.) Tj
T* (2. Zero-Dependency Client-Side ML: Demonstrating that production-grade vectorization, gradient descent,) Tj
T* (momentum, and backpropagation can be implemented cleanly from scratch in TypeScript without bloated) Tj
T* (external machine learning frameworks.) Tj
T* (3. Full-Stack Synergy: Melding rigorous empirical machine learning evaluation with a clean, accessible, and) Tj
T* (responsive user experience.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (The project satisfies all criteria for a technically sound, explainable, and reproducible engineering deliverable.) Tj
