(When demonstrating this project to a review panel or code audit:) Tj
T* (1. Open Dashboard: Highlight real-time financial KPIs, spending distributions, and responsive transaction) Tj
T* (tables.) Tj
T* (2. Open "Add Expense": Type "Chipotle burrito bowl with soda". Show immediate category inference to) Tj
T* ("Food" with ~85% confidence score.) Tj
T* (3. Demonstrate Explainability: Show the top contributing TF-IDF tokens \("chipotle", "burrito", "bowl"\) that led) Tj
T* (the model to this decision.) Tj
T* (4. Demonstrate Human Override: Change the category manually to illustrate that human agency is prioritized) Tj
T* (over automation.) Tj
T* (5. Navigate to "ML Expense Category Assistant": Show the live comparison card between Baseline Logistic) Tj
T* (Regression and Wide & Deep ResNet.) Tj
T* (6. Review Confusion Matrix: Walk through the exact diagonal vs off-diagonal predictions, explaining why) Tj
T* ("Other" is inherently ambiguous.) Tj
T* (7. Demonstrate Dynamic Retraining: Add a custom expense pair in "Model Training & Evaluation". Note how) Tj
T* (the total count increases to 601 and holdout test metrics recalculate dynamically.) Tj
T* (8. Export CSV & Download Reports: Download the CSV file, the full PDF Technical Report, and the) Tj
T* (PowerPoint presentation directly from the application.) Tj
